4. CUDA
-------

This package ships the CUDA kernels as precompiled images (cubins)
inside the binary. They were produced at build time with NVIDIA's
NVRTC from the CUDA 13.0 toolkit; NVRTC itself is NOT part of this
package, is not shipped with it, and is not loaded at runtime.

The NVIDIA driver (`libcuda.so.1`) is loaded dynamically at runtime
and is likewise not part of this package; it is subject to NVIDIA's
licence terms.

